{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/f4c0b39f2e3bab4604f4f0e868798000.avif?t=1771862253\" width=658 height=141 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Wash &amp; Warm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/9a58390506d8a0d06355fb5717a22ad0.poster.avif?t=1771862253\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/9a58390506d8a0d06355fb5717a22ad0.webm?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/9a58390506d8a0d06355fb5717a22ad0.mp4?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A cozy 2D life sim about running a small-town laundry with warm relaxing vibes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the gentle rhythm of <strong>Wash &amp; Warm</strong>, where every stain tells a story and every fold brings peace. Manage your own little laundry in a quiet town, meet charming locals, and watch the world change with the weather and seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort, wash, dry, and iron clothes to each customer\u2019s request. Earn trust, unlock upgrades, decorate your shop, and bring back the warmth to the town\u2019s fading streets,\u00a0 one clean shirt at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/e563e037b2f4ffb46213c1333f372497.avif?t=1771862253\" width=658 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/09b211f69fba423f2b9044cbecd9c9b9.poster.avif?t=1771862253\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/09b211f69fba423f2b9044cbecd9c9b9.webm?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/09b211f69fba423f2b9044cbecd9c9b9.mp4?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Relaxing Laundry Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Wash, dry, and iron with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the simple joy of everyday life through relaxing laundry management. Sort, wash, dry, and iron a variety of clothes while paying attention to each customer\u2019s unique requests, from specific scents to gentle fabrics. Feel the satisfaction of seeing perfectly folded laundry and the rhythmic hum of machines as you turn daily chores into something calm and meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/a3817b6391e084226ee6c6c2bbe872ca.poster.avif?t=1771862253\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/a3817b6391e084226ee6c6c2bbe872ca.webm?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/a3817b6391e084226ee6c6c2bbe872ca.mp4?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Seasons</strong> \u2013 Each day brings new moods and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day in <i>Wash &amp; Warm</i> feels different. Sunny days help clothes dry faster, rainy invite cozy indoor work, and windy test your patience with possibility laundry drops. Across the changing seasons, new colors, lighting, and sounds shape your routines. Adapt to weather-based obstacles and embrace each mood, because even a rainy day can be beautiful in its own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/81c7c3a358e26c1d062a2169d4e7a3f9.poster.avif?t=1771862253\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/81c7c3a358e26c1d062a2169d4e7a3f9.webm?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/81c7c3a358e26c1d062a2169d4e7a3f9.mp4?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Meet Heartfelt Characters</strong> \u2013 From sleepy students to chatty neighbors, each has their own quirks and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little laundry shop is more than just a place to wash clothes, it\u2019s a small hub of life. Meet locals with their own daily worries and small joys: a shy student who hides behind her book, a barista chasing his dreams, a mother caring for her child, and many more. As you fulfill their laundry requests, you\u2019ll slowly uncover pieces of their stories and the quiet warmth of human connection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/84bcb9371df8474384f202b969bd154d.poster.avif?t=1771862253\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/84bcb9371df8474384f202b969bd154d.webm?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/extras/84bcb9371df8474384f202b969bd154d.mp4?t=1771862253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Decorate &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Customize your laundry shop with cozy furniture and efficient machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your humble laundry shop into a welcoming space full of personality. Mix and match interior styles, from rustic wood to ocean breeze or sunflower shine, to create your perfect cozy corner. Upgrade your washers, dryers, and irons to improve efficiency, or add small decorative touches that make customers smile. Every detail you choose adds warmth to your little world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Peaceful Ambience</strong> \u2013 Calming music and warm hand-drawn visuals inspired by Ghibli\u2019s charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a soothing atmosphere where time moves a little slower. Gentle lo-fi tunes, soft lighting, and hand-drawn visuals come together to create a world filled with warmth and nostalgia. Whether it\u2019s the flutter of drying clothes or the faint whistle of wind outside, <i>Wash &amp; Warm</i> invites you to breathe, unwind, and find peace in the ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing perfection in every load or simply enjoying the quiet hum of your washing machine, <strong>Wash &amp; Warm</strong> invites you to slow down, breathe, and find comfort in the everyday.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097440?t=1771862253","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/3e806810fac0434f17b68d8c53da3320f597cd4e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771862253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097440/51c6d1f208f571cf8b0